%% Detailed request lifecycle sequence
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User/UI
    participant F as Flask API (5001)
    participant O as Orchestrator (Node 5101)
    participant A as Atlas Planner
    participant G as Grisha Validator
    participant T as Tetyana Executor
    participant DB as SQLite Memory

    U->>F: chat message
    F->>O: REST /chat
    O->>DB: fetch ranked memory (Atlas & Grisha)
    O->>A: prompt + memory context
    A-->>O: plan draft
    O->>G: plan validation
    G-->>O: precheck verdict (ok/clarify)
    alt needs probe
        O->>T: probe request
        T-->>O: probe artifacts
        O->>G: probe review
        G-->>O: probe assessment
        O->>A: feasibility synthesis
        A-->>O: ADVANCE / CLARIFY decision
    end
    alt proceed execution
        O->>T: execution instructions
        T-->>O: execution result
    else clarify
        O-->>F: clarification request
        F-->>U: ask user
    end
    O->>G: final validation
    G-->>O: verdict + followup
    O->>DB: rememberSafe (key facts)
    O-->>F: response payload
    F-->>U: UI update + stream
    Note over O,DB: memory_context_tokens & injections metrics updated
